WEBVTT

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.430
Wake up, Achan.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.900
Are you awake?

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.390
I took your winter uniform out.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.660
Winter uniform?

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.110
Oh right...

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:37.200
A change of clothes...

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:03.750
Fireworks in Winter

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.640
You're late because you
went back to sleep?

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:16.820
What are you, in first grade?

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.700
Since we're on the road already,
want me to drive you to school?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.390
Just to the station.

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.190
Fumi-chan!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:30.960
Sorry!

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:36.210
I overslept, so my brother drove me here.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.390
I figured as much.

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:52.500
It really feels like autumn's here, huh?

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:53.680
It really does.

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:04.810
Summer seemed so short this year.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.810
It was over before I knew it.

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:09.910
Yeah.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.660
Fujigaya Station

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:40.100
Literary Club

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.110
You're swapping books out?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.820
Yeah. We're throwing away the
old books in the library.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:46.270
They always rope us into helping

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:48.880
since they don't have enough people.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.860
School Library

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:51.740
If you spot them on the shelf,
put them into the box.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:55.270
You take care of World
Literature, Manjome-san.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:57.720
What if the book on the
list has been taken out?

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:03.300
Those are marked with stars,
so you don't need to look for them.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:17.460
Wide Sargasso Sea... Wide Sargasso Sea...

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:20.330
There it is!

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:23.980
Wuthering Heights

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:31.460
Mrs Dalloway... Mrs Dalloway...

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:39.200
All right, to get ready...

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.170
Take a deep breath.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:55.320
Manjome-san! How dare you take a break!

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.660
I'm sorry!

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:57.770
Huh?

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:01.740
You mustn't stop working!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.580
Wow, it worked!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.100
Nice one, Pon-chan!

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.610
You guys are mean!

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.260
When we saw you there...

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.670
...we just had to pull a prank on you.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:15.410
Girls, try not to interfere with her work.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.740
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:21.650
They call what you're doing the "Literary Club tax".

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:22.880
Tax?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:27.210
See, the Literary Club monopolizes
the library, right?

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.690
So to make up for that,

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:31.170
they're forced to help out,
as an agreement of sorts.

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:32.990
As for us in the Drama Club...

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:36.320
We're limited in the number of books we can
take out, so we're given a free pass.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.210
2003 High School Drama Competition

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:43.020
Our Town     -     Hibari     -     Rokumeikan

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:43.020
We're going to choose one of these
three for our next play.

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:45.200
We'll have a vote in January,

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.490
so make sure to read all three
before the end of the year.

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:50.880
You first-years will be able
to be on stage next year,

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:54.670
so read them with the mindset
that you'll be playing those roles.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:55.580
OK.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:06:00.610
We're graduating, so it doesn't
affect us, right?

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:01.450
Right?

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:04.740
Try and ignore the wanton
disregard for their duties.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.240
Now try drawing with bolder strokes

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.830
to give the objects a sense of weight.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:17.530
Don't hold back when you draw.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:18.230
OK.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:21.400
Kazusa! Can you talk to this person?

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.140
He's speaking in English, so I'm totally lost.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:26.230
Maybe it's about Yasuko's study abroad.

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.990
Fine.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.100
Hello?

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:34.240
Excuse me.

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:37.700
Is Sugimoto-sempai going overseas?

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:40.690
Everyone will find out eventually,

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:42.620
but do you think you can
keep it a secret for now?

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:46.660
I don't think she wants people to know.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.550
Fumi-chan!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:00.330
I really thought I was over her.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:01.900
But...

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.230
You can't help it.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:07.800
Your feelings aren't something
you can just turn off at will.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:15.020
I don't understand myself anymore.

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:19.290
Let's eat, Fumi-chan!

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.340
Huh?

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.110
Food is the best cure for these things!

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:25.440
I'm getting a Mont Blanc.

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:29.550
OK, I'll get apple pie.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:31.010
Excuse me!

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.950
Basketball Team in Kanagawa
Prefectural Tournament!!

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:53.790
Basketball Team in Final 4 of National Tournament!!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.380
Matsuoka Girls Academy Basketball Team
Takes Second Place!

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:06.050
Is there anything Sugimoto-sempai
can't do? I'm so jealous!

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:10.030
Did you hear the rumor that
she's going to study abroad?

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:13.410
Yeah. I heard she might be going
to a university in London.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.240
What? No way!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.980
What a shocker!

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:23.540
I heard you're going to be studying
abroad in England.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:28.400
I'm sure you know this already,
but work hard on your studies.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:34.000
I figured I might cry if I did this in
person, so I'm texting it to you.

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:39.660
I plan to continue studying in
Kazusa-sensei's studio. -Kyoko.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:55.870
Christmas Eve?

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:57.070
Yeah.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.040
I don't have any plans.

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.070
Me neither.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.030
Same here.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:06.240
Achan suggested we invite everyone
and throw a Christmas party.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:10.030
Oh, that's a great idea!
Let's exchange gifts, then!

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:11.450
I'm in!

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:15.310
Everyone's really getting into it. I can't wait!

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.890
Awesome.

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:20.250
But it'd be even better if
Ikumi-san joined us too.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.760
Ikumi-san can't make it?

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:25.660
She said she has plans with Sawanoi-san.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.430
Oh. That's a drag.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.320
I'm back.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.890
Hold on, Fumi.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.830
Chizu-chan sent this to you.

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:39.600
Huh?

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:52.950
I moved.
Fumi-chan, come visit me some time. -Chizu

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:57.460
Hey, Fumi.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:58.970
Do you remember your first love?

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:04.920
Do you remember the first person
you fell in love with?

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:10.450
The first person I fell in love with...

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:21.940
Hi, this is Okudaira.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:23.940
Umm, it's Sawanoi.

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:25.340
Ko-san?

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:28.660
Actually, I have a favor to ask you.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:36.470
Sorry to ask you out of the blue like that.
I didn't have anyone else to call on.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:39.460
It's OK. I needed to go shopping anyway.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.500
Though, I'm a little worried.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:47.060
Relax. Just pick out stuff that
you personally would like.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.170
Really?

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:52.550
Yeah. She's sick and tired of the
gifts I normally give her.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:56.230
Well, I'm not too confident
myself, but I'll try.

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.890
How about this?

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.750
No good?

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:24.740
No, I think it's nice.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:27.160
Yeah, I'll get this.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:41.570
Bringing you with me was
definitely a good idea.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.370
You think?

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.350
Yes. I would have never chosen that one.

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:46.990
Huh?

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.700
No, I mean it in a good way.

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:53.200
I'm sure she'll like it.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:55.510
Thank you.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.030
Well, you're very welcome then.

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:02.770
Hmm? Is something the matter?

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:05.090
Umm, hey...

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.680
Are you sure you want
me to drop you here?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:14.230
Yeah, I remembered I had
something to do close by.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:15.640
Oh.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:20.000
In that case, I'll repay you for
your help today next time.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.080
Be careful getting home.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:22.950
Thanks.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:39.260
They're tearing this down next year...

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:53.650
I don't think that Ko-san
and Achan are dating,

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.930
but I don't think I'd mind if they were.

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:02.460
I think if she was, she'd tell me.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:12.800
Why did I hide from them?

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:20.910
Merry Christmas!

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:23.120
That's the third time.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.930
Who cares how many times we do it!

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:27.130
I'm gonna have another piece of cake!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.080
Can I call you Santa?

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.560
I can eat that?

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.880
Yeah. No problem.

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:36.530
S-Sorry for all the commotion.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:39.720
Umm, we're going to be a little loud,

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.730
but it'll only be for two or three more hours...

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:43.600
Looks like fun.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.360
It is!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:49.880
I feel genuinely sorry for the poor
souls spending Christmas alone.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:52.830
Do you have a present for
this poor soul here?

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:53.940
No.

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:56.120
An ice queen, I tell ya.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.300
Hey, you really don't have a present?

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:02.960
Maybe he needs some company
to cheer him up...

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:05.640
None of that! No throwing yourself at him!

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:06.600
Why not?

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:07.790
Sounds like fun!

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:10.190
How many girls are up there?

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.190
Five, counting Akira.

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:16.000
They say that three girls
together are noisy,

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.640
so five must mean a full-out ruckus.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.600
You say such cruel things.

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:23.980
Also, how come I don't count?

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:28.040
No, it's just you... You know.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.070
Know what?

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.490
Wow! That's you, Achan?

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.230
So cute!

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:36.250
You look so adorable in skirts!

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:41.070
Akira & Fumi-chan

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:41.080
You were so tiny, Achan!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.010
Fumi-chan was the tiny one.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.960
That's me here.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.270
What?!

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:53.330
People really do change over time.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.810
I have a pic of us at our school entrance
ceremony. Wanna see?

00:15:55.810 --> 00:15:57.220
I wanna see!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.620
OK, here you go.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.020
The school building is made of wood, huh?

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:18.510
Yeah, but they're tearing
it down next year.

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:19.530
Huh?

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:22.080
They're building a new one.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:27.670
Oh, this is nice.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:29.630
How do I look?

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:32.740
Maybe it's a little... plain.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:36.310
Not at all. I'm grown up now, after all.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:39.090
Grown up, huh?

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.130
Hey, Ko-chan.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.070
I wanna ask you something.

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:58.120
Where'd my scarf go?

00:16:58.120 --> 00:16:59.310
Did you look under the table?

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.040
Yeah. But it wasn't there.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.840
Oh, he told her.

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:04.690
What now?

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:08.990
I grilled him about it because
it was such a nice present.

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:12.600
He 'fessed up and told me
the truth. Thank you.

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.610
Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year.

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:18.320
Told her the truth?

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:19.350
Yeah, actually...

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.850
Ah, found it!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.450
Oh, thank the stars above.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.710
Geez, Yassan.

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.970
Oh... So that's why!

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:32.450
Huh? What is?

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:34.760
Thanks for having us!

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:36.060
Thanks for the food!

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.450
Good night. Get home safe.

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:40.830
See you!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.870
U-Umm...

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.930
Oh!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.320
You did it!

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:59.500
Shut up already!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:00.820
Let's go.

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:04.330
My, it's freezing out here.

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.350
Sakiko-san, will you join me for a drink?

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.300
No.

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:09.140
It's wintertime!

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:12.270
I never expected her to ask him out there.

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:15.450
Motegi-san's incredible.

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:18.230
I don't know what she sees in him.

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.060
I'm turning the lights off.

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:20.960
OK.

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:08.630
You can't sleep?

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:09.410
Huh?

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:13.300
Oh, I'm wide awake for some reason.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.380
Me too, actually.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.610
Look at all that snow!

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:22.920
Wow!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.780
It's a White Christmas.

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:27.390
Say, Achan.

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.140
Hmm?

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:33.870
It's been so long since we've done this.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.620
We used to always come to this park.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.130
You have a good memory, Fumi-chan.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.800
Oh no... Well, maybe.

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:47.760
Oh yeah. You spent the whole day here
in tears, the day you were moving.

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:50.410
Man, that was a pain.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.750
Did I?

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.100
You did.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.880
I was trying to console you but
you wouldn't stop crying.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.750
I don't remember that.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:00.400
Hey! Don't lie to me!

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.480
I'm not!

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:04.050
Ah, Fumi-chan... Gotcha!

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:10.920
They're tearing down our elementary
school building, huh?

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.150
Yeah.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:18.390
I came all the way back to Kamakura
and yet I never visited it again.

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:21.160
I would have liked to have seen it.

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:22.370
Wanna go?

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:23.460
Huh?

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:26.020
Aw crap.

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:26.910
What is it?

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:31.380
I forgot how creepy
schools are at night.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:34.610
Yeah, they kinda are.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:44.190
Say, Fumi-chan, why don't we get going...

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:46.340
Maybe I'll go look over there too.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:49.800
What?! No! Come on, wait!

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:53.200
Hurry up or I'm gonna leave you behind!

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:55.680
I said wait!

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:56.660
Geez!

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.400
I'll get you back!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.090
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.200
Now stop that!

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:13.660
I swear to god, the next person
who picks on me...

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:25.330
That's right. How could I have forgotten?

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:28.940
The first person I fell in love with...

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:31.470
My first love...

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.720
All right? Do we have an understanding?

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:38.780
Huh?

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:43.000
No, Fumi-chan! I'm not mad, really!

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:45.540
No, it's not that.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.250
I just...

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:51.480
remembered something really special.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:53.460
And then, I...

00:21:56.570 --> 00:21:57.460
Oh.

